---
args: --set=types_pretty_printer_engine=old
---

Shared effect in a higher-order function
fun (f, x: Int) { f(x) + 0 } : ((Int) -e-> Int, Int) -e-> Int
stdout : fun : ((Int) -a-> Int, Int) -a-> Int

Independent effect in a curried arrow
fun (f)(x: Int) { f(x) + 0 } : ((Int) -e-> Int) -f-> (Int) -e-> Int
stdout : fun : ((Int) -a-> Int) -> (Int) -a-> Int

Shared effect across a tuple
(map, id) : (((a) -e-> b, [a]) -e-> [b], (c) -e-> c)
stdout : (fun, fun) : (((a) -b-> c, [a]) -b-> [c], (d) -b-> d)

Anonymous effect tails after operation fields
fun(_) {} : (() {F:()|_}-> ()) {F:()|_} -> ()
stdout : fun : (() {F:() => ()|_}-> ()) {F:() => ()|_}-> ()

Single-use effect tails
fun(_) { } : (() -e-> ()) -f-> ()
stdout : fun : (() -> ()) -> ()

Shared effect tail in curried arrows
fun()() { } : () -a-> () -a-> ()
stdout : fun : () -a-> () -a-> ()

Distinct effect tails across a tuple
(fun(){}, fun(){}) : (() -a-> (), () -b-> ())
stdout : (fun, fun) : (() -> (), () -> ())

Type alias with an anonymous effect tail
fun() {} : Comp((), { | e })
stdout : fun : Comp ((),{ |_ })

Curried function returning a computation type alias
fun()() {} : () -e-> Comp((), { | f })
stdout : fun : () -> Comp ((),{ |_ })

Type aliases with a shared effect tail
fun(x) {x} : (Comp(a, { | e })) -f-> Comp(a, { | e })
stdout : fun : (Comp (a,{ |b })) -> Comp (a,{ |b })
